  "content": "<h2>关于</h2><h1>森罗物语：末地-重织</h1><blockquote>\n  <p>一个为森罗物语：厨房带来末地扩展的Minecraft模组。</p>\n</blockquote><h2>纲要</h2><ul>\n<li>此为<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252fkaleidoscope-end\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><strong>森罗物语：末地</strong></a>模组的<strong>Fabric移植版</strong>。</li>\n<li>需要<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252fkaleidoscope-cookery-refabricated\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><strong>森罗物语：厨房-重织</strong></a>作为前置。</li>\n<li>抱歉，暂无向后移植计划。</li>\n</ul><h2>概览</h2><p><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/badge/Minecraft-Java Edition-brightgreen\" alt=\"Minecraft\">\n<img src=\"https://img.shields.io/badge/Fabric- 1.21.1| 1.21.11| 26.2.1| 26.2-orange\" alt=\"Fabric\">\n<img src=\"https://img.shields.io/badge/License-MIT-blue\" alt=\"许可证\"><br>\n末地也需要美食！本模组为森罗物语：厨房带来了末地相关的扩展。</p><p>你可以在末地找到两种新作物：梦之莓与末影薄荷。</p><h3>🍽️ 多元料理</h3><p>龙族料理：包括龙息紫颂汤、熟末影龙肉、龙蛋煎蛋等；</p><p>潜影贝料理：例如酿潜影贝、潜影贝冰淇淋；</p><p>紫颂果系列：紫颂意面、紫颂花茶、紫颂花蛋糕。</p><p>还有……圆滚滚的末地毛毛虫。</p><h3>✨ 新效果与机制</h3><p>食用龙蛋料理会带来独特的新效果……</p><p>可疑的龙蛋……？</p><p><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/53efdeace61fd8654eda31d662e865baf0c350cd_0.webp\" alt=\"img\"></p><h3>原作者授权</h3><p><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/fc1569f57486a71b75749ac0207c9261119a364f.png\" alt=\"授权截图\"></p>",
